                                                "example_id": "82df675a-2b78-4bea-81ea-44df082229aa",
                                                "sense_id": "776ec893-c12c-3a47-b5d1-c9fddd607e1c",
                                                "text": "[…]behind them a granola-looking mom in denim overalls and a t-shirt was pulling in to do her drop-off . . . from a Prius."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b763480-88d3-4961-af8a-779021bf645e",
                                                "sense_id": "776ec893-c12c-3a47-b5d1-c9fddd607e1c",
                                                "text": "You see more and more of the granola hippie activist types these days."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a202d4ae-5298-4126-bfc1-ddaf60e8c838",
                                                "sense_id": "776ec893-c12c-3a47-b5d1-c9fddd607e1c",
                                                "text": "Rather, the anti-vax movement is almost entirely a phenomenon of the affluent crunchy granola Left—as everyone across the political spectrum acknowledged until the last week or so."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ca23360-1ab2-4d65-a08d-e789460b4efe",
                                                "sense_id": "776ec893-c12c-3a47-b5d1-c9fddd607e1c",
                                                "text": "Yet some experts believe that voices from the far right are beginning to drown out those of the crunchy granola crowd."
